title: "Mojiang purple rice (ZN65) T2T genome — analysis code"
abstract: "Analysis pipeline and figure-generation code for the gap-free telomere-to-telomere genome of the purple-pericarp rice landrace Mojiang ZN65 (Oryza sativa) and its transposon-associated structural variation at the pericarp-pigmentation loci."
